  <reporting-org ref="XI-IATI-CWSEC" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Commonwealth Secretariat</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Public Debt Management Framework and developing government bond market?in Bahamas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project strengthens and reforms the governance structure for public debt management, the policy framework and development of government securities market in The Bahamas. Building on the progress made in 2021-22 with the finalisation and enactment of the Public Debt Management Act 2021, the establishment of the Debt Management Office and the development of the First Medium Term Debt Management Strategy (MTDS) the project will continue to work with The Bahamas to achieve sound debt management practices. ???</narrative>
  </description>
